    "sub_ename": "FINANCIAL RISK MANAGEMENT AND INVESTMENT",
    "describe_ch": "了解公司管理機制、風險評估以及在公司風險管理(ERM)中的最佳化經營；學習金融業中，各種風險評估及衡量方式，以及應用於投資風險之管理。",
    "describe_eh": "Understand the mechanism of enterprise governance and the feature of a best practice in ERM system; Learn different risk metrics and its measurement in the financial industry along with its application in investment risk management.",
